  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Experiments for Dev. of Climate Smart Agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Experiments for development of climate smart solutions for sustainable intensification of agriculture in Malawi. Partners will jointly research two specific areas: 1) to assess ways to transform the existing input subsidy program to a program that more strongly stimulates Climate Smart Agriculture through reducing storage losses and land degradation. 2) land and water rights in relation to irrigation agriculture which holds potential but where institutional challenges need more attention.</narrative>
  </description>
